{"parse": {"title": "Anime Adventures Wiki", "pageid": 5670, "revid": 40594, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family: &#39;Fredoka One&#39;,rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"main-page-warning\"><span class=\"main-page-warning&#95;text\">The Wiki is outdated</span>, it will be updated soon so please give us some time.</div>\n<div class=\"custom-main-page-tag-lcs custom-main-page-tag-lcs-exploded\">\n<div class=\"custom-lcs-container\">\n<div style=\"background: #643be633; font-size: 13.5px; border-radius: 25px; padding: 16px;box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #4200ff8c, inset 0 0 9px 0px #6248ac8f;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end; float: right; flex-direction: column;\">\n<div style=\"user-select: none;margin: 3px 10px;background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(72 0 255 / 71%) 0%, #853be636 20px);border-radius: 10px;box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #4200ff8c, inset 0 0 9px 0px #6248ac8f;\">\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgb(8 5 5 / 15%) 20%, hwb(213deg 0% 0% / 20%) 50%, rgb(0 0 0 / 15%) 80%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%); text-shadow: 0px 7px 20px #9600ffa3; text-align: center; box-shadow: inset 0px 3px 20px 3px #3232326b; border-radius: 10px;color: #fff; padding: 2px 89px; width: 100%;\">\n<h3 style=\"line-height: 2;font-size: 140%;font-weight: 500; margin: 0;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h3></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"mobileonly\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_2\"><b>About</b></span></h3><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/c9/Logo.png/revision/latest?cb=20220828054644\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Logo\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/c9/Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/260?cb=20220828054644\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"260\" height=\"114\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>A catastrophic event has occurred that summoned countless threats in multiple worlds... but it also brought all the heroes together, and they need your help! 😱Can you summon the strongest heroes and save these worlds together?<br />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/8304191830\">Anime Adventures</a> is a tower defense game made by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/groups/10611639\">Gomu</a>. It was created on December 21, 2021 and officially released on July 3, 2022. Team up with others to beat ascending levels, or do it yourself and triumph above the strongest of enemies. Players gain <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\">Gems</a> from beating <a href=\"/wiki/Story\" title=\"Story\">Story</a> and Infinite modes which can be used to <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summon</a> more <a href=\"/wiki/Unit_List\" title=\"Unit List\">characters</a>, or to buy <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">items</a> from the Travelling Merchant Shop. Level up your characters by beating Story and Infinite mode or using <a href=\"/wiki/Items#XP_Food\" title=\"Items\">XP Food</a> to make them stronger!</div>\n<div style=\"margin: 10px 0 12px;\"><div style=\"font-family: &#39;Fredoka One&#39;,rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; user-select: none; margin: 3px 0 8px; border-radius: 25px 25px 0 0; background: #643be633; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #4200ff8c, inset 0 0 9px 0px #6248ac8f; text-shadow: 0px 2px 20px #9600ffa3;text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"line-height: 2;font-size: 140%;font-weight: 500; margin: 0;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Navigation\">Main Navigation</span></h3></div>\n<h3 class=\"mobileonly\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Navigation_2\"><b>Main Navigation</b></span></h3>\n<di